      "end": 170.16,
      "text": "No easy little villains drawn to comfort them",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 170.16,
      "end": 174.56,
      "text": "I can fear a policy, I can ask it why",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 174.56,
      "end": 179.0,
      "text": "Without turning every neighbor into an enemy tonight",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
