      "text": "We carry different maps through the same front gate",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 190.18,
      "end": 194.6,
      "text": "Strange neighborhood, I'm still standing here",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 194.6,
      "end": 199.2,
      "text": "With a stubborn little hope beneath the noise and fear",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 199.2,
      "end": 203.68,
      "text": "Strange neighborhood, let the hard words land",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 203.68,
      "end": 207.8,
      "text": "Then build a better table with an open hand",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 207.8,
      "end": 212.66,
